{"seq":3,"slug":"sampling-strategies","title":"采样策略：Head-based、Tail-based 与 Adaptive","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/foundations/sampling-strategies","wordCount":1192,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"采样策略-head-based-tail-based-与-adaptive\">采样策略：Head-based、Tail-based 与 Adaptive</h1><p>高流量微服务系统每秒可产出数百万个 Span。如果全量采集、传输和存储这些数据，网络带宽、存储成本和后端查询性能都将面临巨大压力。采样策略的核心问题是：如何在数据完整性和成本之间找到最优平衡点——既不遗漏关键的错误和慢请求，又不为正常流量付出过多代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>采样决策可以在数据生命周期的不同阶段做出，这决定了策略的类型和权衡：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Head[&quot;Head-based 采样&quot;]&#10;        H1[&quot;请求到达&quot;] --&gt; H2[&quot;立即决定&lt;br/&gt;采样 or 丢弃&quot;]&#10;        H2 --&gt; H3[&quot;决策随 Context&lt;br/&gt;传播到下游&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Tail[&quot;Tail-based 采样&quot;]&#10;        T1[&quot;所有 Span&lt;br/&gt;先完整采集&quot;] --&gt; T2[&quot;Collector 缓存&lt;br/&gt;完整 Trace&quot;]&#10;        T2 --&gt; T3[&quot;Trace 结束后&lt;br/&gt;按规则筛选&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Adaptive[&quot;Adaptive 采样&quot;]&#10;        A1[&quot;实时统计&lt;br/&gt;流量特征&quot;] --&gt; A2[&quot;动态调整&lt;br/&gt;采样率&quot;]&#10;        A2 --&gt; A3[&quot;兼顾成本&lt;br/&gt;与覆盖率&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Head[\"Head-based 采样\"]\n        H1[\"请求到达\"] --&gt; H2[\"立即决定&lt;br/&gt;采样 or 丢弃\"]\n        H2 --&gt; H3[\"决策随 Context&lt;br/&gt;传播到下游\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Tail[\"Tail-based 采样\"]\n        T1[\"所有 Span&lt;br/&gt;先完整采集\"] --&gt; T2[\"Collector 缓存&lt;br/&gt;完整 Trace\"]\n        T2 --&gt; T3[\"Trace 结束后&lt;br/&gt;按规则筛选\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Adaptive[\"Adaptive 采样\"]\n        A1[\"实时统计&lt;br/&gt;流量特征\"] --&gt; A2[\"动态调整&lt;br/&gt;采样率\"]\n        A2 --&gt; A3[\"兼顾成本&lt;br/&gt;与覆盖率\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略类型</th>\n<th>决策时机</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Head-based</td>\n<td>请求入口（Root Span 创建时）</td>\n<td>零额外延迟，低资源开销</td>\n<td>决策时缺乏完整链路信息，可能丢弃有价值的 Trace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tail-based</td>\n<td>Trace 完成后（Collector 层）</td>\n<td>可基于完整链路做智能决策</td>\n<td>需缓存所有 Span 直到 Trace 结束，内存开销大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adaptive</td>\n<td>持续运行（动态调整参数）</td>\n<td>自适应流量波动，兼顾成本与覆盖</td>\n<td>实现复杂，需要反馈回路</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"head-based-采样策略详解\">Head-based 采样策略详解</h2><p>Head-based 采样在 Root Span 创建时立即做出&quot;采样&quot;或&quot;不采样&quot;的决定，并通过 <code>traceparent</code> 的 trace-flags 字段向下游传播这个决定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"常见-head-based-sampler\">常见 Head-based Sampler</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Sampler</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AlwaysSample</td>\n<td>100% 采样</td>\n<td>开发/测试环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NeverSample</td>\n<td>0% 采样</td>\n<td>极高流量下临时关闭追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TraceIDRatioBased(p)</td>\n<td>按 TraceID 的哈希值以概率 p 采样</td>\n<td>生产环境默认策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ParentBased(root)</td>\n<td>如果上游已决策，遵循上游；否则使用 root sampler</td>\n<td>保持链路一致性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"parentbased-的决策逻辑\">ParentBased 的决策逻辑</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    REQ[&quot;入站请求&quot;] --&gt; HAS[&quot;携带 traceparent？&quot;]&#10;    HAS --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| REMOTE[&quot;远程父 Span 已采样？&quot;]&#10;    HAS --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| ROOT[&quot;使用 Root Sampler&lt;br/&gt;(如 TraceIDRatioBased)&quot;]&#10;    REMOTE --&gt;|&quot;已采样 (flag=01)&quot;| YES[&quot;采样本 Span&quot;]&#10;    REMOTE --&gt;|&quot;未采样 (flag=00)&quot;| NO[&quot;不采样本 Span&quot;]&#10;    ROOT --&gt; DEC[&quot;计算采样决策&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    REQ[\"入站请求\"] --&gt; HAS[\"携带 traceparent？\"]\n    HAS --&gt;|\"是\"| REMOTE[\"远程父 Span 已采样？\"]\n    HAS --&gt;|\"否\"| ROOT[\"使用 Root Sampler&lt;br/&gt;(如 TraceIDRatioBased)\"]\n    REMOTE --&gt;|\"已采样 (flag=01)\"| YES[\"采样本 Span\"]\n    REMOTE --&gt;|\"未采样 (flag=00)\"| NO[\"不采样本 Span\"]\n    ROOT --&gt; DEC[\"计算采样决策\"]</pre><p>生产推荐配置：<code>ParentBased(TraceIDRatioBased(0.1))</code> —— 对新链路 10% 采样，对已有链路遵循上游决策，确保同一条 Trace 的所有 Span 要么全部采集、要么全部丢弃。</p>\n<h3 id=\"单调一致性问题\">单调一致性问题</h3><p>一个关键约束：同一条 Trace 内，所有服务的采样决策必须一致。如果服务 A 决定采样但服务 B 决定丢弃，链路就会出现断点。<code>ParentBased</code> Sampler 正是为解决此问题而设计——下游始终遵循上游的采样标志位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tail-based-采样策略详解\">Tail-based 采样策略详解</h2><p>Tail-based 采样将决策推迟到 Trace 的所有 Span 到达 Collector 之后，此时可以基于完整链路信息做出更智能的筛选。</p>\n<h3 id=\"决策规则示例\">决策规则示例</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>采样动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>错误优先</td>\n<td>Trace 包含 <code>status=ERROR</code> 的 Span</td>\n<td>100% 保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>慢请求</td>\n<td>Root Span duration &gt; 5s</td>\n<td>100% 保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高价值路径</td>\n<td>涉及支付/退款的 API</td>\n<td>100% 保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正常流量</td>\n<td>不匹配上述规则</td>\n<td>10% 采样</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"opentelemetry-collector-的-tail-sampling-processor\">OpenTelemetry Collector 的 Tail Sampling Processor</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"processors:&#10;  tail_sampling:&#10;    decision_wait: 30s # 等待 Trace 完成的最大时间&#10;    num_traces: 100000 # 内存中缓存的最大 Trace 数&#10;    policies:&#10;      - name: errors-policy&#10;        type: status_code&#10;        status_code: { status_codes: [ERROR] }&#10;      - name: latency-policy&#10;        type: latency&#10;        latency: { threshold_ms: 5000 }&#10;      - name: probability-policy&#10;        type: probabilistic&#10;        probabilistic: { sampling_percentage: 10 }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tail_sampling</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    decision_wait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30s</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 等待 Trace 完成的最大时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    num_traces</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100000</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 内存中缓存的最大 Trace 数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    policies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">errors-policy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">status_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        status_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">status_codes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ERROR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">latency-policy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">latency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        latency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">threshold_ms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">probability-policy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">probabilistic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        probabilistic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">sampling_percentage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"tail-based-的工程挑战\">Tail-based 的工程挑战</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>应对方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存压力</td>\n<td>需缓存所有 Span 直到 Trace 结束</td>\n<td>设置 <code>decision_wait</code> 上限 + <code>num_traces</code> 容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trace 不完整</td>\n<td>分布式系统中 Span 可能延迟到达</td>\n<td>配置合理的等待窗口 + 部分决策 fallback</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多 Collector 实例</td>\n<td>同一 Trace 的 Span 可能落在不同实例</td>\n<td>使用 Load Balancing Exporter 按 TraceID hash 路由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高吞吐延迟</td>\n<td>Span 在内存中等待增加了端到端延迟</td>\n<td>只对非实时分析链路启用 tail sampling</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"adaptive-采样-动态反馈\">Adaptive 采样：动态反馈</h2><p>Adaptive 采样根据实时流量特征动态调整采样率。Grafana Tempo 3.0 的 TraceQL Metrics Sampling 就是此类策略的代表实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// Tempo 3.0 自适应采样查询&#10;{} | rate() with(sample=true)&#10;&#10;// 显式指定 span 采样率&#10;{} | rate() with(span_sample=0.1)&#10;&#10;// 显式指定 trace 采样率&#10;{} | rate() with(trace_sample=0.05)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Tempo 3.0 自适应采样查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{} | rate() with(sample=true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 显式指定 span 采样率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{} | rate() with(span_sample=0.1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 显式指定 trace 采样率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{} | rate() with(trace_sample=0.05)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自适应采样的反馈回路\">自适应采样的反馈回路</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    INGEST[&quot;Span 摄入流量&quot;] --&gt; STAT[&quot;统计当前 QPS&lt;br/&gt;和匹配密度&quot;]&#10;    STAT --&gt; DECIDE[&quot;匹配稀少?&lt;br/&gt;保持高采样率&quot;]&#10;    STAT --&gt; DECIDE2[&quot;匹配密集?&lt;br/&gt;降低采样率&quot;]&#10;    DECIDE --&gt; APPLY[&quot;采样率 ≈ 100%&quot;]&#10;    DECIDE2 --&gt; APPLY2[&quot;采样率动态降低&quot;]&#10;    APPLY --&gt; QUALITY[&quot;信号质量高&lt;br/&gt;性能开销低&quot;]&#10;    APPLY2 --&gt; QUALITY\">flowchart TD\n    INGEST[\"Span 摄入流量\"] --&gt; STAT[\"统计当前 QPS&lt;br/&gt;和匹配密度\"]\n    STAT --&gt; DECIDE[\"匹配稀少?&lt;br/&gt;保持高采样率\"]\n    STAT --&gt; DECIDE2[\"匹配密集?&lt;br/&gt;降低采样率\"]\n    DECIDE --&gt; APPLY[\"采样率 ≈ 100%\"]\n    DECIDE2 --&gt; APPLY2[\"采样率动态降低\"]\n    APPLY --&gt; QUALITY[\"信号质量高&lt;br/&gt;性能开销低\"]\n    APPLY2 --&gt; QUALITY</pre><p>核心思想：当某类 Span 稀少时（如错误），保持接近 100% 的采样率确保不遗漏；当某类 Span 密集时（如正常 2xx 请求），大幅降低采样率控制成本。这比固定比率采样能提供更均匀的信号质量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生产环境采样架构推荐\">生产环境采样架构推荐</h2><p>对于中大型系统，推荐组合使用多层采样：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SDK 层</td>\n<td>ParentBased(TraceIDRatio(0.5))</td>\n<td>前置过滤，减少 50% 的网络传输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Collector 层</td>\n<td>Tail Sampling (errors + latency)</td>\n<td>智能保留有价值 Trace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储层</td>\n<td>Tempo Adaptive Sampling</td>\n<td>查询时按需采样，控制扫描量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键原则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>SDK 采样率<strong>不要设得太低</strong>——被 SDK 丢弃的 Span 永远无法被 Tail Sampling 挽救</li>\n<li>Tail Sampling 需要路由保证——同一 Trace 的 Span 必须到达同一个 Collector 实例</li>\n<li>高价值路径（支付、认证）单独配置策略，不受全局采样率影响</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Head-based 采样简单高效但&quot;盲决策&quot;，推荐 <code>ParentBased(TraceIDRatioBased)</code> 保证链路一致性</li>\n<li>Tail-based 采样基于完整链路做智能决策，但需解决内存和路由问题</li>\n<li>Adaptive 采样动态调整率，在稀疏信号场景下效果显著</li>\n<li>生产中通常 SDK + Collector + 存储三层组合采样，层层递进过滤</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"context-propagation\">上下文传播机制</a>：采样决策如何通过 trace-flags 传播</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../observability-engineering/distributed-tracing/tracing-concepts\">可观测性工程中的追踪概念</a>：追踪在可观测性体系中的宏观定位</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"采样策略：Head-based、Tail-based 与 Adaptive","id":"采样策略-head-based-tail-based-与-adaptive"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Head-based 采样策略详解","id":"head-based-采样策略详解"},{"level":3,"text":"常见 Head-based Sampler","id":"常见-head-based-sampler"},{"level":3,"text":"ParentBased 的决策逻辑","id":"parentbased-的决策逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"单调一致性问题","id":"单调一致性问题"},{"level":2,"text":"Tail-based 采样策略详解","id":"tail-based-采样策略详解"},{"level":3,"text":"决策规则示例","id":"决策规则示例"},{"level":3,"text":"OpenTelemetry Collector 的 Tail Sampling Processor","id":"opentelemetry-collector-的-tail-sampling-processor"},{"level":3,"text":"Tail-based 的工程挑战","id":"tail-based-的工程挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"Adaptive 采样：动态反馈","id":"adaptive-采样-动态反馈"},{"level":3,"text":"自适应采样的反馈回路","id":"自适应采样的反馈回路"},{"level":2,"text":"生产环境采样架构推荐","id":"生产环境采样架构推荐"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"上下文传播机制：W3C TraceContext 与跨进程关联","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/foundations/context-propagation"},"next":{"title":"OpenTelemetry SDK 架构与生产配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/implementation/opentelemetry-sdk"}}